    not touching any grid edge
  blockers:
    color: 1 (blue), solid rectangles, 2-8 rows x 2-9 cols
    count: 1-4 per grid
    placement: each blocker overlaps the source's row-band or col-band (but not both) so it blocks horizontal or vertical rays; 16/17 blockers are in a ray path [observed]
    partial coverage: a blocker typically covers 14-100% of the source rows/cols it faces
  passthrough_objects:
